I like this proposal a lot. It couldn't hurt to add these to jbovlaste.

The only problem is if you've used a {se du'u} or {se li'i} etc. To make a=
=20
NU-anaphora in that case you would have to do something gross like {lo'u se=
=20
du'u le'u bu}. Or you could just use {du'ubu} anyway if it's not ambiguous.

mu'o mi'e la durka

